        "created_at": "2016-07-14T02:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, Omnitron can turn on a dime and become quite viscious, even w/out the extra plays from Cosmic Omnitron's flip side.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Was playing a game recently where I'd set up Omnitron to take a beating from a high-powered team buffed by Legacy. Took quite a bit of effort to surve when both EPEs came out in the same turn, right after the Flechettes had wiped much of our stuff.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
